    "# PART 2: Systematic Testing - Failure Diagnosis\n",
    "## Objective: Run each prompt multiple times (5, 10, 15 iterations) to identify failure patterns"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "id": "7c026580",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
